---
manual: background.paints_over_earlier
lines: [2758, 2761]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: C12
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 200, height: 200 do
  fill red
  nostroke
  rect 20, 20, 60, 60
  oval 120, 20, 60
  background blue
end
----------- test code
assert_equal [0, 0, 255], pixel_at(50, 50).first(3), "a background after a rect paints over it"
assert_equal [0, 0, 255], pixel_at(150, 50).first(3), "and over an oval"
